, uh, called Aurora?\", \"oh and when did we… when did we last talk?\", \"ok different thing, um, can you show me the photos I took recently?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0049\", \"v\": [[\"um can you show me, uh, photos of Orsolya Goodenough?\", \"oh and could you, um, add a to-do to call the Yealmpton photo\", \"ok different thing, uh, get rid of every doorbell photo\", \"no wait wait, undo that\"], [\"Could you please show me photos of Orsolya Goodenough?\", \"Would you mind adding a task to call the Yealmpton photo?\", \"Also, could you please delete every doorbell photo I have?\", \"Oh, sorry, could you please undo that? I didn't mean to.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0050\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you settle up with Tonu in the, uh, number 88 flat?\", \"ok and, um, what are the subtasks for the replace the woodpecker this week task?\", \"oh and what did I pay for the… the enow deposit?\", \"um do I have any documents about, uh, footbridge?\"], [\"Tonu and I have been going back and forth on bills for ages, so could you just settle up with Tonu in number 88 flat and clear it?\", \"I'm trying to get my head around what's left to do, so what subtasks are under the replace the woodpecker this week task?\", \"Someone asked me earlier and I honestly couldn't remember, so what did I pay for the enow deposit?\", \"I'm digging through old paperwork, so do I have any documents about footbridge saved anywhere?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0051\", \"v\": [[\"thirteen kroner for Tonu's taxi, number 88 flat, I paid\"], [\"add thirteen kroner for Tonu's taxi to number 88 flat, i paid for it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0053\", \"v\": [[\"um can you tick off the giraffe task?\", \"ok different thing, what've I, uh, written in the Kazbegi trips notebook?\", \"wait, how many of them are there?\", \"and um… Paragliding?\", \"oh and how much did the, uh, cedar cost?\"], [\"tick off the giraffe task pls\", \"whats in my Kazbegi trips notebook\", \"how many r there\", \"and Paragliding?\", \"how much was the cedar\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0054\", \"v\": [[\"um how much do I, uh, owe Goran?\"], [\"Goran brought up money the other day and I've completely lost track, so what's my debt to Goran at the moment?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0055\", \"v\": [[\"I'm always the one who forgets to send cards, so could you tell me whose birthdays are coming up in the next two months?\", \"My notes are a total mess and half of them are old checklists, so could you clear out every list note I've got?\"], [\"Could you tell me whose birthdays are coming up over the next two months, please?\", \"Would you mind clearing out each list note I have?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0056\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please clear what's owed between me and Sathette?\", \"Also, could you tell me what time the Arcachon thing is?\", \"Never mind, please. It's not important.\"], [\"um can you clear what's, like, owed between me and Sathette?\", \"oh and uh what time's the Arcachon thing?\", \"ah never mind, forget it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0057\", \"v\": [[\"um how much does Tonu Zaki owe me in, uh, number 88 flat?\", \"ah actually forget it\"], [\"Could you tell me how much Tonu Zaki owes me in number 88 flat?\", \"Actually, please forget it. Thank you anyway.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0058\", \"v\": [[\"pics with Flolara Zaki\", \"forget it\", \"when's the Widad thing?\", \"number 88 flat expenses over 130 kroner\"], [\"Could you please show me pictures with Flolara Zaki in them?\", \"Actually, please forget it.\", \"Also, could you tell me when the Widad business is?\", \"On another matter, could you show me the number 88 flat expenses above 130 kroner, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0059\", \"v\": [[\"um can you square up my Enow trip balance with Gristine?\", \"oh and, uh, what date's Bethan's birthday on?\", \"ah forget it\"], [\"square Enow trip with Gristine\", \"Bethan's birthday date?\", \"forget it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0001\", \"v\": [[\"show me pics of Fionnuala Rivas\"], [\"I'm putting together a little slideshow, so could you pull up the photos of Fionnuala Rivas for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0002\", \"v\": [[\"I want to actually get a card out in good time this year, so when is Halima's birthday?\"], [\"Could you tell me when Halima's birthday is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0003\", \"v\": [[\"um when's my walk with Halima?\", \"ok and, uh, when do I have the call aylin thing?\", \"and the, um, the cresvaet?\", \"oh and is there anything in my expenses about it too?\"], [\"walk with Halima when?\", \"call aylin when?\", \"and the cresvaet?\", \"anything in expenses on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0004\", \"v\": [[\"umm is anything happening tomorrow?\", \"ok can you move the first one to, uh, next friday?\", \"and what's on, um, tuesday?\", \"oh can you shift the hurling one to wednesday?\"], [\"anything tomorrow?\", \"first one to next friday\", \"what's on tuesday\", \"hurling one to wednesday\"]]}","ttft_ms":27044,"type":"result","duration_ms":41206,"uuid":"b276ad5a-f69b-479f-8af8-6b25c3d394dc","ttft_stream_ms":1439,"time_to_request_ms":166,"first_content_frame_ms":1439,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22233587,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278783975.6877,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
